    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/9eee32935f2ccd19ffd4e01dcd08da21.avif?t=1739791395\" width=800 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2500\u2500&quot;Ghosturbance Cases&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supernatural phenomena beyond human comprehension, seemingly the work of spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As these incidents rapidly increased, they came to be known as <strong>&quot;Ghosturbance Cases&quot;</strong> and became part of everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Angelic Agency,&quot; an organization investigating these cases, assigns its officer, Tsujitsuma, to a murder investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While Tsujitsuma approaches the case as part of his duties, the story takes an unexpected turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to unraveling all these incidents lies in\u2014<strong>&quot;memories.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/da1125170d03a58e4f7fd1f8f34fd2b5.avif?t=1739791395\" width=800 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Angelic Agency: Soul Salvation Unit&quot; is a mystery adventure featuring a public security duo tackling supernatural cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of <strong>Tsujitsuma</strong>, a member of the <strong>&quot;Angelic Agency&quot;</strong> investigating <strong>&quot;Ghosturbance Cases.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses through three phases: <strong>(1) Conversation Part, (2) Deduction Part, and (3) Salvation Part.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players navigate these phases to uncover the truth behind each incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/3dde0d4517225442c2e85c281a6613a4.avif?t=1739791395\" width=676 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(1) Conversation Part</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to characters' stories and gather information by investigating scenes through point-and-click interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(2) Deduction Part</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden truths using collected evidence and testimonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;memories&quot; of spirits serve as keys to solving the cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(3) Salvation Part</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflect on the entirety of the incident and deliver judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/a12e6b71088f4604d72be7d8914afd15.avif?t=1739791395\" width=730 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/8f7ca963b1614c48f107ea30e3c77fa9.avif?t=1739791395\" width=800 height=59 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel featuring numerous illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-and-click investigations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parameters that change based on choices, leading to multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/74087b51af1eb9ccf140e6ada4da3852.avif?t=1739791395\" width=626 height=352 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/9eee32935f2ccd19ffd4e01dcd08da21.avif?t=1739791395\" width=800 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2500\u2500&quot;Ghosturbance Cases&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supernatural phenomena beyond human comprehension, seemingly the work of spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As these incidents rapidly increased, they came to be known as <strong>&quot;Ghosturbance Cases&quot;</strong> and became part of everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Angelic Agency,&quot; an organization investigating these cases, assigns its officer, Tsujitsuma, to a murder investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While Tsujitsuma approaches the case as part of his duties, the story takes an unexpected turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to unraveling all these incidents lies in\u2014<strong>&quot;memories.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/da1125170d03a58e4f7fd1f8f34fd2b5.avif?t=1739791395\" width=800 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Angelic Agency: Soul Salvation Unit&quot; is a mystery adventure featuring a public security duo tackling supernatural cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of <strong>Tsujitsuma</strong>, a member of the <strong>&quot;Angelic Agency&quot;</strong> investigating <strong>&quot;Ghosturbance Cases.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses through three phases: <strong>(1) Conversation Part, (2) Deduction Part, and (3) Salvation Part.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players navigate these phases to uncover the truth behind each incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/3dde0d4517225442c2e85c281a6613a4.avif?t=1739791395\" width=676 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(1) Conversation Part</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to characters' stories and gather information by investigating scenes through point-and-click interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(2) Deduction Part</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden truths using collected evidence and testimonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;memories&quot; of spirits serve as keys to solving the cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(3) Salvation Part</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflect on the entirety of the incident and deliver judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/a12e6b71088f4604d72be7d8914afd15.avif?t=1739791395\" width=730 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/8f7ca963b1614c48f107ea30e3c77fa9.avif?t=1739791395\" width=800 height=59 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel featuring numerous illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-and-click investigations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parameters that change based on choices, leading to multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/74087b51af1eb9ccf140e6ada4da3852.avif?t=1739791395\" width=626 height=352 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
